cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "NAMD Analysis (namd-analysis)"
message: >-
  If NAMD Analysis contributes to published work, please cite this release and also
  Hefei-NAMD and CA-NAC, which produce the dynamics and couplings it analyses.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gutsev
    given-names: Lavrenty G.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9679-9093"
    affiliation: "Louisiana Tech University"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23224678"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lgutsev/NAMD_Analysis"
abstract: >-
  Analysis of saved CA-NAC / Hefei-NAMD output with explicit units and state mappings:
  fragment-resolved state character, crossing episodes, ensemble statistics that never
  pool distinct configurations, identifiability-aware multistate kinetic fits, and
  VACF phonon spectra.
keywords:
  - nonadiabatic molecular dynamics
  - surface hopping
  - kinetic modelling
  - halide perovskites
license: MIT
version: 0.7.2
date-released: 2026-10-07
